        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alice Munro, Lillian Hellman\n- Works: The Moons of Jupiter\n- Organizations: Nobel Prize, Macmillan of Canada\n- Topics: short story writing, drama, screenwriting, political activism\n\nFacts:\n- Lillian Hellman was born on June 20, 1905, and she was an American dramatist and screenwriter.\n- Lillian Hellman was known for her success as a playwright on Broadway and for her left-wing sympathies and political activism.\n- Alice Munro was born on July 10, 1931, née Laidlaw, and she is a Canadian short story writer and Nobel Prize winner.\n- The Moons of Jupiter is a book of short stories by Alice Munro that was published by Macmillan of Canada in 1982.\n- Lillian Hellman died on June 30, 1984.",
